            thought. And my "month" is still going on, for years now.`,author:{name:"@Ajabun",months:"32",imageUrl:this.getImageUrl("ajabun.jpeg")}},testimonials:[[[{body:`Premium is well worth the money and saves your eyes with
                Dark Mode, Covers Mode along with a robust Series Discovery
                feature, all backed by the developer that actually listens!`,author:{name:"@Punkdog",months:"36",imageUrl:this.getImageUrl("punkdog.jpeg")}},{body:`What I love about Kenmei is its vibrant community,
                where your feedback can shape the platform, and the exclusive
                early access perks which truly elevates your manga tracking
                experience.`,author:{name:"@Medc",months:"8",imageUrl:this.getImageUrl("medc.jpeg")}},{body:`I've been part of Premium since its conception. I love
                the previews of new features that I didn't even know I wanted
                while also getting the core quality of life features for the
                price.`,author:{name:"@ennui_enthusiast",months:"20",imageUrl:this.getImageUrl("gloob.jpeg")}}],[{body:`After using Kenmei for a while as a free user, I
                decided to give the app a bit of support by going premium.
                Last month, I made the easiest decision of my life by renewing
                my annual subscription.`,author:{name:"@Sanzouille",months:"24",imageUrl:this.getImageUrl("sanzouille.jpeg")}},{body:`I've seen a few things move from Early Access to
                all-users including things I suggested, and it feels great to
                know I had some impact. With the ability to try out and
                contribute to WIP and Early Access features,
                I couldn't be happier to be able to support this.`,author:{name:"@Siri-母ちゃん",months:"24",imageUrl:this.getImageUrl("siri.jpeg")}}]],[[{body:`Kenmei has always been the best way to track what I read,
                  but Premium is even better! We are constantly getting new
                  features before everyone else, and our voice are really heard
                  by the developer.`,author:{name:"@LeLecteurCG",months:"7",imageUrl:this.getImageUrl("le_lecteur_cg.jpeg")}},{body:`Kenmei has 0 contest to other tracking tools, the
                developer is constantly listening to feedback and improving
                the app, premium was a no brainer.`,author:{name:"@Callial",months:"10",imageUrl:this.getImageUrl("callial.jpeg")}}],[{body:`Kenmei has transformed the challenging task of series
                tracking into an enjoyable and effortless experience for me.
                Access to early features for experimentation and providing
                feedback has been incredibly rewarding`,author:{name:"@Akira「アキラ」",months:"4",imageUrl:this.getImageUrl("akira.gif")}},{body:`Premium lets me support Kenmei so that everyone can
                  enjoy new features and improvements. Plus it also comes with
                  awesome perks.`,author:{name:"@appleiron",months:"36",imageUrl:this.getImageUrl("appleiron.jpeg")}},{body:`Getting the premium version was the best thing ever,
                I always know about the newest changes and, to be honest, having
