            flexibility to cancel at any time before the renewal date, and you
            won't lose access to the premium features. In fact, you can cancel
            as soon as you subscribe to try out Premium for a month.`},{question:"What happens if I upgrade or downgrade?",answer:`We pro-rate your subscription, making it seamless for you.
            If you upgrade, you'll only pay the difference. Conversely,
            if you downgrade, you'll receive credit towards your next payment
            cycle, so you'll pay less next time. Simple and fair!`},{question:"What happens to my customizations when I unsubscribe?",answer:`We retain all your custom changes on our servers, but you
            lose access to them when you unsubscribe. For instance, your
            banner or custom Discovery collections won't be shown. However, if
            you re-subscribe, they will automatically be visible to you again.`},{question:"How can I cancel my subscription?",answer:`You can easily cancel your subscription by going to the
            Settings → Pricing section. Your cancellation will take effect at
            the end of the current billing cycle, allowing you to continue using
            Premium features until the renewal date.`},{question:"When will Elite tier be introduced?",answer:`We don't have a specific release date for this tier.
            It will be rolled out as soon as the functionality is ready.
            If you subscribe to Lite or Pro, you'll have the option to upgrade
            to the new tier when it becomes available.`},{question:"Can I pay using crypto?",answer:`Currently, we do not have plans to support
            cryptocurrency payments.`},{question:"How long do features remain in Early Access?",answer:`The duration of Early Access for features is not fixed.
            Features are typically released when they reach a certain level of
            polish and when another new feature is ready to take their place.`}]}}},aNe=xe(oNe,[["render",iNe],["__scopeId","data-v-1af12004"]]),lNe={class:"feature-highlight"},cNe={class:"overflow-hidden"},uNe={class:"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-12 lg_px-8"},dNe={class:"feature-highlight--wrapper"},fNe={class:"lg_max-w-lg"},pNe=["textContent"],hNe={class:"mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm_text-4xl"},mNe={class:"mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-gray-600"},gNe=["textContent"],vNe=["srcset"],_Ne=["srcset"],yNe=["srcset"],bNe=["srcset"],wNe=["src"];function xNe(e,t,n,r,s,i){return g(),R("div",lNe,[v("div",cNe,[v("div",uNe,[v("div",dNe,[v("div",{class:he(n.alignment=="right"?"lg_pr-8 lg_pt-4":"lg_ml-auto lg_pl-4 lg_pt-4")},[v("div",fNe,[v("h2",{textContent:G(n.feature.title)},null,8,pNe),v("p",hNe,G(n.feature.subtitle),1),v("p",mNe,G(n.feature.description),1),v("dl",null,[(g(!0),R(oe,null,Te(n.feature.highlights,o=>(g(),R("div",{class:"relative pl-9",key:o.name},[v("dt",null,[(g(),T(Ne(o.icon),{class:"absolute left-1 top-1 h-5 w-5 text-blue-600","aria-hidden":"true"})),Q(G(o.name),1)]),t[0]||(t[0]=Q(G(" "),-1)),v("dd",{class:"inline",textContent:G(o.description)},null,8,gNe)]))),128))])])],2),v("div",{class:he(n.alignment=="right"?"":"flex items-start justify-end lg_order-first")},[v("picture",null,[v("source",{type:"image/webp",media:"(max-width: 455px)",srcset:i.getImageUrl(n.feature.image.mobile.webp)},null,8,vNe),v("source",{type:"image/webp",media:"(min-width: 456px)",srcset:i.getImageUrl(n.feature.image.desktop.webp)},null,8,_Ne),v("source",{type:"image/jpeg",media:"(max-width: 455px)",srcset:i.getImageUrl(n.feature.image.mobile.jpeg)},null,8,yNe),v("source",{type:"image/jpeg",media:"(min-width: 456px)",srcset:i.getImageUrl(n.feature.image.desktop.jpeg)},null,8,bNe),v("img",{src:n.feature.image.desktop.jpeg,alt:"Smart Suggestions Screenshot",loading:"lazy"},null,8,wNe)])],2)])])])])}const SNe={props:{feature:{type:Object,required:!0},alignment:{type