 and agree to these Terms of Use on your behalf.</p><h2 data-v-18400e5e>Services</h2><p data-v-18400e5e>Through the Site, we aggregate, track and discover titles of comics.</p><p data-v-18400e5e>To our Free Users, we provide basic product information and links to comics publishers and their publications and updates. Our Premium Users, in addition to this, receive extra features such as covers, suggestions and prompts to new comics publications or translations and different site customization options.</p><p data-v-18400e5e>We are constantly updating our Services to improve the Site&#39;s functionality and features. You should regularly check these terms or the Site for any changes we may make.</p><h2 data-v-18400e5e>Site management</h2><p data-v-18400e5e>We reserve the right, but not the obligation, to:</p><ol data-v-18400e5e><li data-v-18400e5e>monitor the Site for violations of these Terms of Use;</li><li data-v-18400e5e>take appropriate legal action against anyone who violates the law or these Terms of Use including reporting such user to law enforcement authorities;</li><li data-v-18400e5e>in our sole discretion refuse, restrict access to, limit the availability of, or disable (to the extent technologically feasible) any of your Contributions or any portion of it;</li><li data-v-18400e5e>in our sole discretion to remove from the Site or otherwise disable all files and content that are excessive in size or are in any way burdensome to our systems;</li><li data-v-18400e5e>otherwise manage the Site in a manner designed to protect our rights and property and to facilitate the proper functioning of the Site.</li></ol><p data-v-18400e5e>The information provided on the Site is not intended for distribution to or use by any person or entity in any jurisdiction or country where such distribution or use would be contrary to law or regulation or would subject us to any registration requirement within such jurisdiction or country. Users who access the Site from such locations do so on their own initiative and are responsible for compliance with local laws, if and to the extent local laws are applicable.</p><h2 data-v-18400e5e>Users</h2><p data-v-18400e5e>You may access the Site and some of our Services as a Free User without creating an account. But if you want to access all our available free features, or become a Premium User, you must create an account by completing the registration form and providing the information requested.</p><p data-v-18400e5e>You will need to choose a password and a username. You are responsible for keeping your password and account safe. You are responsible for any activities regarding your account.</p><p data-v-18400e5e>You agree to notify us immediately of any unauthorized use of your account or any other breach of security. We will not be liable for any loss that you may incur as a result of someone else using your password or account, either with or without your knowledge. However, you could be held liable for losses incurred by us or another party due to someone else using your account or password. You may not use anyone else&#39;s account at any time, without the permission of the account holder.</p><p data-v-18400e5e>We reserve the right to remove, reclaim, or change a username if we determine, in our sole discretion, that such username is inappropriate, obscene, or otherwise objectionable.</p><h2 data-v-18400e5e>User representations</h2><p data-v-18400e5e>By using the Site, you represent and warrant that:</p><ol data-v-18400e5e><li data-v-18400e5e>all registration information you submit will be true, accurate, current, and complete;</li><li data-v-18400e5e>you will maintain the accuracy of such information and update it if necessary;</li><li data-v-18400e5e>you have the legal capacity and you agree to comply with these Terms of Use;</li><li data-v-18400e5e>you are not under the age of 13 or a minor in the jurisdiction in which you reside, or if a minor, you have received parental permission to use the Site;</li><li data-v-18400e5e>your use of the Site will not violate any applicable law or regulation.</li><li data-v-18400e5e>you will not:<ol data-v-18400e5e><li data-v-18400e5e>use the Site for any illegal or unauthorized purpose;</li><li data-v-18400e5e>access the Site through automated or non-human means, whether through a bot, script or otherwise;</li><li data-v-18400e5e>interfere with, disrupt, or create an undue burden on the Site or the networks or services connected to the Site;</li><li data-v-18400e5e>attempt to impersonate another user or person;</li><li data-v-18400e5e>use the username of another user.</li><li data-v-18400e5e>use the Site as part of any effort to compete with us or otherwise use the Site or the Content for any revenue-generating commercial enterprise;</li><li data-v-18400e5e>decipher, decompile, disassemble, or reverse engineer any of the software comprising or in any way making up a part of the Site;</li><li data-v-18400e5e>attempt to bypass any measures of the Site designed to prevent or restrict access to the Site, or any part of the Site;</li><li data-v-18400e5e>copy or adapt the Site&#39;s software, including but not limited to PHP, HTML, JavaScript, or other code;</li><li data-v-18400e5e>Except as a result of standard search engine or Internet browser usage, use, launch, develop, or distribute any automated system, such as, any spider, robot, cheat utility, scraper, or offline reader that accesses the Site, or using or launching any unauthorized script or other software;</li><li data-v-18400e5e>Circumvent, disable, or interfere with security-related features of the Site, including features that prevent or restrict the use or copying of any Content or enforce limitations on the use of the Site or the Content;</li><li data-v-18400e5e>Systematically retrieve data or other content from the Site to create or compile, directly or indirectly, a collection, compilation, database, or directory without written permission from us.</li></ol></li></ol><p data-v-18400e5e>If you provide any information that is untrue, inaccurate, not current, or incomplete, we have the right to suspend or terminate your account and refuse any future use of the Site.</p><h2 data-v-18400e5e>Fees and payment</h2><p data-v-18400e5e>You may be required to pay a fee to access some of our Services.</p><p data-v-18400e5e>Our fees depend on the membership tier you choose. We bill you through an online billing account for purchases made via the Site. We may change our fees at any time but we will give you prior notice</p><p data-v-18400e5e>You agree to provide current, complete, and accurate purchase and account information for all purchases made via the Site. You agree to promptly update account and payment information, including email address, payment method, and payment card expiration date so that we can complete your transactions and contact you as needed.</p><p data-v-18400e5e>You agree to pay all charges or fees at the prices in effect, and authorize us to charge your chosen payment provider for any such amounts upon making your purchase. If your purchase is subject to recurring charges, you consent to our charging your payment method on a recurring basis without requiring your prior approval for each recurring charge.</p><p data-v-18400e5e>We reserve the right to correct any errors or mistakes in pricing, even if we have requested or received payment. We reserve the right to refuse any order placed through the Site.</p><p data-v-18400e5e>We reserve the right to add membership tiers or amend the Services that we offer to the Free Users or Premium Users. If you have any questions, do not hesitate to contact us.</p><h2 data-v-18400e5e>Cancellation</h2><p data-v-18400e5e>You may cancel your subscription at any time by logging into your account.</p><p data-v-18400e5e>Your cancellation will take effect at the end of the current paid month. No refunds are offered after the Services have commenced and are in progress for that subscription month.</p><p data-v-18400e5e>If you are unsatisfied with our services, please email us at <a href="mailto:legal@kenmei.co" data-v-18400e5e>legal@kenmei.co</a>.</p><h2 data-v-18400e5e>User Generated Contributions</h2><p data-v-18400e5e>The Site does not allow users to submit or post content. We may in the future provide you with the opportunity to create, submit, post, display, transmit, perform, publish, distribute, or broadcast content and materials on the Site, such as text, writings, video, audio, photographs, graphics, comments, suggestions, or personal information or other material (&quot;Contributions&quot;). If we allow User Generated Contributions, we will update our Terms of Use to reflect this.</p><h2 data-v-18400e5e>Submissions</h2><p data-v-18400e5e>You agree that any questions, comments, suggestions, ideas, feedback, or other information regarding the Site (&quot;Submissions&quot;) provided by you to us are non-confidential and are our sole property. We own exclusive rights, including all intellectual property rights, and are entitled to the unrestricted use and dissemination of these Submissions for any lawful purpose, commercial or otherwise, without acknowledgment or compensation to you. You waive all moral rights to any such Submissions, and you warrant that any such Submissions are your original work or that you have the right to submit such Submissions.</p><p data-v-18400e5e>You agree there shall be no recourse against us for any alleged or actual infringement or misappropriation of any proprietary right in your Submissions.</p><h2 data-v-18400e5e>Termination</h2><p data-v-18400e5e>We reserve the right to deny access to and use of the Site (including blocking certain IP addresses), to any person and for any reason, including, without limitation, for breach of any representation, warranty or covenant contained in these Terms of Use or any applicable law or regulation. We may terminate your use or participation in the Site or delete your account.</p><h2 data-v-18400e5e>Intellectual Property rights</h2><p data-v-18400e5e>Unless otherwise indicated, the Site is our proprietary property and all source code, databases, functionality, software, website designs, audio, video, text, photographs, and graphics associated with our name or with the Site (the &quot;Content&quot;) are owned or controlled by us or licensed to us, or are the property of their respective owners and are used to our knowledge in accordance with copyright legislation.</p><p data-v-18400e5e>The Content is provided on the Site on an &quot;as is&quot; basis. You are granted a limited license to access and use the Site and to download or print a copy of any portion of the Content to which you have properly gained access solely for your personal use. No part of the Site and no Content may be copied, reproduced, aggregated, republished, uploaded, posted, publicly displayed, encoded, translated, transmitted, distributed, sold, licensed, or otherwise exploited for any commercial purpose.</p><h2 data-v-18400e5e>Third-Party Content</h2><p data-v-18400e5e>Our Site uses algorithms to collect data automatically with little active human review and input. Our Site may contain (or you may be sent) links to third-party websites, articles, photographs, text, graphics, pictures, designs, music, sound, video, information, applications, software, and other content or items belonging to or originating from third parties (&quot;Third-Party Content&quot;).</p><p data-v-18400e5e>Third-Party Content is not investigated, monitored, or checked for accuracy, appropriateness, or completeness by us, compliance with intellectual property or other laws and we are not responsible for any Third-Party Content posted on, available through, or installed from the Site, including the content, accuracy, offensiveness, opinions, reliability, privacy practices, or other policies of or contained in the Third-Party Content.</p><p data-v-18400e5e>Inclusion of, linking to, or permitting the use or installation of any Third-Party Content does not imply approval or endorsement by us. If you decide to leave the Site and access the Third-Party Content, you do so at your own risk, and you should be aware these Terms of Use no longer govern that. You should review the applicable terms and policies of any website to which you navigate from the Site or relating to any content you access from the Site.</p><p data-v-18400e5e>For any purchases you make through Third-Party Content we take no responsibility whatsoever in relation to such purchases which are exclusively between you and the applicable vendor. You agree and acknowledge that we do not endorse the products or services offered outside our Site and you shall hold us harmless from any harm caused by your purchase of such products or services.</p><p data-v-18400e5e>As with the purchase of any product or service through any medium or environment, you should use your best judgment and exercise caution. We do not warrant, endorse, guarantee or assume responsibility for any Third-Party Content product or service advertised or offered through the Site, any hyperlinked website or any website or mobile application featured in any banner or other advertising. We will not be party to or in any way responsible for monitoring any transaction between you and any third-party provider of products or services.</p><p data-v-18400e5e>You must hold us harmless from any losses sustained by you or harm caused to you relating to or resulting in any way from any Third-Party Content.</p><h2 data-v-18400e5e>Privacy Policy and User Data</h2>',50)),v("p",null,[t[1]||(t[1]=Q("We care about data privacy and security. Please review our Privacy Policy ",-1)),y(o,{to:"/privacy"},{default:A(()=>[...t[0]||(t[0]=[Q("here",-1)])]),_:1}),t[2]||(t[2]=Q(".",-1))]),t[7]||(t[7]=v("p",null,"By using the Site, you agree to be bound by our Privacy Policy, which is incorporated into these Terms of Use. Please be advised the Site is hosted in Ireland.",-1)),t[8]||(t[8]=v("p",null,"If you access the Site from any other region of the world with laws or other requirements governing personal data collection, use, or disclosure that differ from applicable laws in Ireland, then through your continued use of the Site, you are transferring your data to Ireland, and you agree to have your data transferred to and processed in Ireland.",-1)),t[9]||(t[9]=v("p",null,"If we receive actual knowledge that anyone under the age of 13 has provided personal information to us without the requisite and verifiable parental consent, we will delete that information from the Site as quickly as is reasonably practical.",-1)),t[10]||(t[10]=v("p",null,"The company uses cookies to enable us to retrieve user details for each visit. We will maintain data that you transmit to the Site to manage the performance of the Site and your use of the Site. Although we perform regular routine backups you are solely responsible for all data that you transmit or that relates to any activity you have undertaken using the Site. You agree that we shall have no liability to you for any loss or corruption of any such data, and you hereby waive any right of action against us arising from any such loss or corruption of such data.",-1)),v("p",null,[t[4]||(t[4]=Q("You can read our Cookies Policy by clicking ",-1)),y(o,{to:"/privacy"},{default:A(()=>[...t[3]||(t[3]=[Q("here",-1)])]),_:1}),t[5]||(t[5]=Q(".",-1))]),t[11]||(t[11]=Er('<h2 data-v-18400e5e>Modifications</h2><p data-v-18400e5e>You agree that the use of our Site is at your sole risk. We cannot guarantee the Site will be available at all times. We may experience hardware, software, or other problems or need to perform maintenance related to the Site, resulting in interruptions, delays, or errors.</p><p data-v-18400e5e>We reserve the right to change, modify, or remove the Services or any contents of the Site at any time or for any reason at our sole discretion without notice. We will not be liable to you or any third party for any modification, price change, suspension, or discontinuance of the Site.</p><p data-v-18400e5e>You agree that we have no liability whatsoever for any loss, damage, or inconvenience caused by your inability to access or use the Site during any downtime or discontinuance of the Site. Nothing in these Terms of Use will be construed to require us to maintain and support the Site or to supply any corrections or updates.</p><p data-v-18400e5e>We make no representations or warranties on the accuracy, completeness, reliability or content of any information or service provided through our Site. We make no warranties of any title or implied warranties of fitness for purpose other than those which cannot be excluded.</p><h2 data-v-18400e5e>Limitation of liability</h2><p data-v-18400e5e>Neither we nor our affiliates nor any of our directors, employees or agents, or licensors are liable for any damages, including without limitation, direct, indirect, incidental, special, consequential or punitive damages arising out of the use of or inability to use the Site.</p><p data-v-18400e5e>We exclude liability for any damages caused by any failure of performance, error, omission, interruption, deletion, defect, delay in operation or transmission, computer virus, communication line failure, theft or destruction or unauthorised access to, alteration of or use of record, whether for breach of contract, tort, negligence or any other cause of action. You acknowledge that we are not liable for the defamatory, offensive or illegal conduct of Third-Party Content and that the risk of any damage or loss caused by any Third-Party Content rests entirely with you, the User. Notwithstanding the liability we may have, this is limited to the amount paid to us during the three months prior to any cause of action arising.</p><h2 data-v-18400e5e>Indemnification</h2><p data-v-18400e5e>You agree to defend, indemnify, and hold us harmless, including our subsidiaries, affiliates, directors, officers, agents, partners, and employees, from and against any loss, damage, liability, claim, or demand, including legal fees and expenses, made by any third party due to or arising out of your:</p><ol data-v-18400e5e><li data-v-18400e5e>use of the Site;</li><li data-v-18400e5e>breach of these Terms of Use;</li><li data-v-18400e5e>breach of your representations and warranties;</li><li data-v-18400e5e>violation of the rights of a third party, including intellectual property rights; or</li><li data-v-18400e5e>harmful act toward any other user of the Site with whom you connected via the Site.</li></ol><p data-v-18400e5e>We reserve the right, at your expense, to assume any defense and control of any matter for which you are required to indemnify us, and you agree to cooperate, at your expense, with our defense of such claims. We will use reasonable efforts to notify you of any such claim, action, or proceeding which is subject to this indemnification upon becoming aware of it.</p><h2 data-v-18400e5e>Electronic Communications, Transactions and Signatures</h2><p data-v-18400e5e>Visiting the Site, sending us emails, and completing online forms constitute electronic communications. You consent to receive electronic communications, and you agree that all agreements, notices, disclosures, and other communications we provide to you electronically, via email and on the Site, satisfy any legal requirement that such communication be in writing.</p><p data-v-18400e5e>You agree to the use of electronic signatures, contracts, and other records and electronic delivery of notices, policies and records of transactions initiated or completed by us or via the Site. You waive any rights or requirements under any statutes, regulations, rules, ordinances or other laws in any jurisdiction which require original signature or delivery or retention of non-electronic records, payments or the granting of credits by any means other than electronic.</p><h2 data-v-18400e5e>Miscellaneous</h2><p data-v-18400e5e>These Terms of Use and any policies posted by us on the Site constitute the entire agreement and understanding between you and us.</p><p data-v-18400e5e>We reserve the right to correct any errors, inaccuracies, or omissions including descriptions, and pricing and to change the information on the Site at any time without prior notice.</p><p data-v-18400e5e>Our failure to exercise or enforce any right or provision of these Terms of Use shall not operate as a waiver of such right or provision.</p><p data-v-18400e5e>We may assign any or all of our rights and obligations to others at any time.</p><p data-v-18400e5e>We shall not be responsible or liable for any loss, damage, delay, or failure to act caused by any cause beyond our reasonable control.</p><p data-v-18400e5e>If any provision or part of a provision of these Terms of Use is determined to be unlawful, void, or unenforceable, that provision or part of the provision is deemed severable from these Terms of Use and does not affect the validity and enforceability of any remaining provisions.</p><h2 data-v-18400e5e>Governing law</h2><p data-v-18400e5e>These Terms of Use are governed by and interpreted in accordance with the laws of England and Wales. If you reside in the EU and are a consumer, you may be protected by provisions of the law of your country of residence. Studio Shogun LTD and you agree to submit to the non-exclusive jurisdiction of England and Wales courts, but you may make a claim under these Terms of Use in England and Wales, or in the EU country in which you reside.</p><h2 data-v-18400e5e>Dispute Resolution</h2><p data-v-18400e5e>The European Commission provides an online dispute resolution platform, which you can access here: <a href="https://ec.europa.eu/consumers/odr" data-v-18400e5e>https://ec.europa.eu/consumers/odr</a>. If you would like to bring this subject to our attention, please contact us.</p><h2 data-v-18400e5e>Contact us</h2><p data-v-18400e5e>In order to resolve a complaint regarding the Site or to receive further information regarding the use of the Site, please contact us at: <a href="mailto:legal@kenmei.co" data-v-18400e5e>legal@kenmei.co</a>.</p>',28))])])])}const fot={head(){return{title:"Terms of Service | Kenmei"}}},pot=xe(fot,[["render",dot],["__scopeId","data-v-18400e5e"]]),hot={class:"relative py-16 bg-white overflow-hidden dark_bg-slate-700"},mot={class:"relative px-4 sm_px-6 lg_px-8"},got={class:"mt-6 prose prose-neutral prose-lg mx-auto dark_prose-invert"};function vot(e,t,n,r,s,i){const o=D("router-link");return g(),R("div",hot,[v("div",mot,[t[5]||(t[5]=v("div",{class:"text-lg max-w-prose mx-auto"},[v("h1",null,[v("span",{class:"block text-base text-center text-blue-600 font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase dark_text-moon-yellow-400"},"Updated on 20/05/2025"),v("span",{class:"mt-2 block text-3xl text-center leading-8 font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm_text-4xl dark_text-white"},"Privacy Policy")])],-1)),v("div",got,[t[3]||(t[3]=Er('<p data-v-57e01350>At Studio Shogun LTD (&quot;we&quot;, &quot;us&quot;, &quot;our&quot;) we take privacy very seriously and are committed to protecting your personal information and your right to privacy.</p><p data-v-57e01350>In this privacy policy, we want to explain as clearly as possible what information we collect, how we use it and what rights you have in relation to it.</p><p data-v-57e01350>This policy applies to all information collected through our Services and Site as well as any related services, sales, marketing or events.</p><p data-v-57e01350>We hope you take some time to read through it carefully, as it is important.</p><p data-v-57e01350>Your use of the Site is taken as acceptance of this policy. If there are any terms that you disagree with, please discontinue using our Services immediately.</p><p data-v-57e01350>If you have any questions or concerns about this policy, or our practices with regards to your personal information, please contact us at <a href="mailto: hi@kenmei.co" data-v-57e01350>hi@kenmei.co</a>.</p><h3 data-v-57e01350>Information you provide to us</h3><ul data-v-57e01350><li data-v-57e01350><strong data-v-57e01350>Account and profile information:</strong> We collect information about you when you register for an account, create or modify your profile, set preferences, sign-up for or make purchases through the Services. For example, this includes your email address, profile picture, and notification settings.</li><li data-v-57e01350><strong data-v-57e01350>Information you provide through our support channels:</strong> The Services also include customer support, where you may choose to submit information regarding a problem you are experiencing with a Service. Whether you contact customer support via email, Discord or otherwise engage with our support team, you will be asked to provide contact information, a summary of the problem you are experiencing, and any other documentation, screenshots or information that would be helpful in resolving the issue.</li><li data-v-57e01350><strong data-v-57e01350>Payment information:</strong> We may collect data necessary to process your payment if you make purchases, such as your payment instrument number (such as a credit card number), and the security code associated with your payment instrument. All payment data is stored by Stripe. You may find their privacy notice link(s) here: <a href="https://stripe.com/en-gb/privacy" target="_blank" data-v-57e01350>https://stripe.com/en-gb/privacy</a>.</li></ul><h3 data-v-57e01350>Information we collect automatically</h3><p data-v-57e01350>We collect information about you when you use our Services, including browsing our websites and taking certain actions within the Services. This includes:</p><ul data-v-57e01350><li data-v-57e01350>Internet Protocol (IP) addresses.</li><li data-v-57e01350>Internet Service Provider (ISP).</li><li data-v-57e01350>Browser type.</li><li data-v-57e01350>Operating system.</li><li data-v-57e01350>Date/time stamp.</li><li data-v-57e01350>Browsing actions and browsing patterns.</li></ul>',11)),v("p",null,[t[1]||(t[1]=Q("Some of this information is collected using cookies. For more details about our Cookies Policy, please click ",-1)),y(o,{to:"/cookies"},{default:A(()=>[...t[0]||(t[0]=[Q("here",-1)])]),_:1}),t[2]||(t[2]=Q(".",-1))]),t[4]||(t[4]=Er('<h4 data-v-57e01350>Consent</h4><p data-v-57e01350>You may choose to browse our Site freely without becoming a member. If you do not become a member, you will not be able to access areas that require registration.</p><p data-v-57e01350>We will ask you when we need information that identifies you or allows us to contact you (personal information). To become a Free User or Premium user, you must consent to this policy before becoming a member. If you do not consent to provide us with the personal information requested, you cannot use our Services.</p><p data-v-57e01350>If you decide to register as a Free User or a Premium User, you will be able to select the kind of information you want to receive from us by subscribing to our Services (such as newsletters). If you do not want us to communicate with you about our offers, products, programs, events, or services by email, or telephone, you may select the option stating that you do not wish to receive any marketing messages from us.</p><h2 data-v-57e01350>How we use the information</h2><p data-v-57e01350>How we use the information we collect depends in part on which Services you use, how you use them, and any preferences you have communicated to us. Below are the specific purposes for which we use the information we collect about you:</p><ul data-v-57e01350><li data-v-57e01350>To provide the Services.</li><li data-v-57e01350>To personalize your experience.</li><li data-v-57e01350>To aid in research and development.</li><li data-v-57e01350>To communicate with you about the Services.</li><li data-v-57e01350>To market, promote, and drive engagement with the Services.</li><li data-v-57e01350>To provide customer support.</li><li data-v-57e01350>To prevent fraud and abuse.</li><li data-v-57e01350>For any other purpose with your consent.</li></ul><p data-v-57e01350>We will never sell or give away your name, address, phone number, email or any personal information to anyone without a legitimate reason as set out below.</p><h2 data-v-57e01350>How we share the information</h2><h3 data-v-57e01350>Sharing with third parties</h3><ul data-v-57e01350><li data-v-57e01350><strong data-v-57e01350>With your consent:</strong> We share information about you with third parties when you give us consent to do so.</li><li data-v-57e01350><strong data-v-57e01350>Service providers:</strong> We work with service providers for our Site and application development, hosting, maintenance, backup, storage, infrastructure, payment processing, analysis and other services. This may require them to access or use information about you. If a service provider needs to access information about you to perform services on our behalf, they do so under instruction from us, including abiding by policies and procedures designed to protect your information. You can learn more about third-party service providers in the Subprocessors section.</li><li data-v-57e01350><strong data-v-57e01350>Compelled disclosure:</strong> We may need to use or disclose your personal information if required by law or if we reasonably believe that use or disclosure is necessary to protect our rights, protect your safety or the safety of others, investigate fraud, or comply with a law, court order, or legal process.</li></ul><h2 data-v-57e01350>How we store and secure the information</h2><h3 data-v-57e01350>Information storage and security</h3><p data-v-57e01350>We use data hosting service providers to host the information we collect, and we use technical measures to secure your data. While we implement safeguards designed to protect your information, no security system is impenetrable and due to the inherent nature of the Internet, we cannot guarantee that data, during transmission through the Internet or while stored on our systems or otherwise in our care, is absolutely safe from intrusion by others. We will respond to requests about information storage and security within a reasonable timeframe.</p><h3 data-v-57e01350>Infrastructure Subprocessors</h3><p data-v-57e01350>We may use the following Subprocessors to host Customer Data or provide other infrastructure that helps with delivery of our Services:</p><table class="text-left" data-v-57e01350><thead data-v-57e01350><tr data-v-57e01350><th data-v-57e01350>Entity Name</th><th data-v-57e01350>Subprocessing Activities</th><th data-v-57e01350>Entity Country</th><th data-v-57e01350>Data Location</th></tr></thead><tbody data-v-57e01350><tr data-v-57e01350><td data-v-57e01350>Heroku</td><td data-v-57e01350>Cloud Platform Services</td><td data-v-57e01350>United States</td><td data-v-57e01350>Europe</td></tr><tr data-v-57e01350><td data-v-57e01350>Render</td><td data-v-57e01350>Cloud Platform Services</td><td data-v-57e01350>United States</td><td data-v-57e01350>Europe</td></tr><tr data-v-57e01350><td data-v-57e01350>Amazon Web Services EMEA SARL</td><td data-v-57e01350>Cloud Service Provider</td><td data-v-57e01350>Luxembourg</td><td data-v-57e01350>Europe</td></tr></tbody></table><h3 data-v-57e01350>Other Subprocessors</h3><p data-v-57e01350>We may use the following Subprocessors to perform other Service functions:</p><table class="text-left" data-v-57e01350><thead data-v-57e01350><tr data-v-57e01350><th data-v-57e01350>Entity Name</th><th data-v-57e01350>Subprocessing Activities</th><th data-v-57e01350>Entity Country</th><th data-v-57e01350>Data Location</th></tr></thead><tbody data-v-57e01350><tr data-v-57e01350><td data-v-57e01350>Stripe</td><td data-v-57e01350>Payment Processor</td><td data-v-57e01350>United States</td><td data-v-57e01350>Europe</td></tr><tr data-v-57e01350><td data-v-57e01350>Travis.io</td><td data-v-57e01350>Cloud Service Provider</td><td data-v-57e01350>Germany</td><td data-v-57e01350>Europe</td></tr><tr data-v-57e01350><td data-v-57e01350>Mailgun</td><td data-v-57e01350>Cloud Email Services</td><td data-v-57e01350>United States</td><td data-v-57e01350>Europe</td></tr><tr data-v-57e01350><td data-v-57e01350>Sentry</td><td data-v-57e01350>Error &amp; Performance Monitoring</td><td data-v-57e01350>United States</td><td data-v-57e01350>United States</td></tr><tr data-v-57e01350><td data-v-57e01350>Scout</td><td data-v-57e01350>Performance Monitoring</td><td data-v-57e01350>United States</td><td data-v-57e01350>United States</td></tr><tr data-v-57e01350><td data-v-57e01350>PostHog</td><td data-v-57e01350>Data Analytics</td><td data-v-57e01350>United States</td><td data-v-57e01350>Europe</td></tr></tbody></table><h3 data-v-57e01350>How long we keep information</h3><p data-v-57e01350>We may retain your personal information for a period of time consistent with the original purpose of collection. For instance, we may retain your personal information during the time you have an account to use the Services, and for a reasonable period of time thereafter. We also may retain your personal information during the period of time needed for us to pursue our legitimate business interests, conduct audits, comply with our legal obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce our agreements.</p><h2 data-v-57e01350>How to access and control your information</h2><h3 data-v-57e01350>Right to access and update information</h3><p data-v-57e01350>Our Site allows you to access and update information about you. You can access your profile information from your account. You can update this from your profile settings. Please make sure that the information we hold on you is current and correct.</p><h3 data-v-57e01350>Right to data portability</h3><p data-v-57e01350>Data portability is the ability to obtain some of your information in a format you can move from one service provider to another. Our Services and related documentation give you the ability to export certain information from within the Service. Should you request it by contacting us using the contact information at the end of this Privacy Policy, we will provide you with an electronic file of your basic account information and information under your sole control. We will respond to your request within a reasonable timeframe and notify you of the action we have taken.</p><h2 data-v-57e01350>Other important privacy-related information</h2><p data-v-57e01350>We may transfer, process, and store your information outside your country of residence, to wherever we or our service providers operate to provide the Service. Whenever we transfer your information, we will take steps to protect it.</p><h3 data-v-57e01350>Age limitations</h3><p data-v-57e01350>To the extent prohibited by law, we do not allow our Services to be used by anyone younger than 13 years old. If you learn that anyone younger than 13 has unlawfully provided us with personal data, please contact us and we will take steps to delete it.</p><h3 data-v-57e01350>Changes to our Privacy Policy</h3><p data-v-57e01350>We may change this privacy policy. We will post any changes on this page and, if they are significant, we will provide a notice on the Site, login screens, or by sending you an email. We encourage you to review this policy routinely to stay informed about our information practices and the ways you can help protect your privacy.</p><h3 data-v-57e01350>Contact Us</h3><p data-v-57e01350>If you have questions or concerns about how your information is handled, please direct your inquiry to Studio Shogun LTD at <a href="mailto: legal@kenmei.co" data-v-57e01350>legal@kenmei.co</a>.</p>',35))])])])}const _ot={head(){return{title:"Privacy Policy | Kenmei",meta:[{name:"description",content:"Find out more about our Privacy Policy"},{property:"og:url",content:"https://www.kenmei.co/privacy"},{name:"twitter:title",content:"Kenmei | Privacy Policy"},{name:"twitter:description",content:"Find out more about our Privacy Policy"}]}}},_v=xe(_ot,[["render",vot],["__scopeId","data-v-57e01350"]]),yot={class:"relative py-16 bg-white overflow-hidden dark_bg-slate-700"};function bot(e,t,n,r,s,i){return g(),R("div",yot,[...t[0]||(t[0]=[Er('<div class="relative px-4 sm_px-6 lg_px-8" data-v-733b5d30><div class="text-lg max-w-prose mx-auto" data-v-733b5d30><h1 data-v-733b5d30><span class="block text-base text-center text-blue-600 font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase dark_text-moon-yellow-400" data-v-733b5d30>Updated on 28/02/2025</span><span class="mt-2 block text-3xl text-center leading-8 font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm_text-4xl dark_text-white" data-v-733b5d30>Cookie Policy</span></h1></div><div class="mt-12 prose prose-neutral prose-lg mx-auto dark_prose-invert" data-v-733b5d30><p data-v-733b5d30>Our Site uses cookies, pixels and other technology (collectively &quot;cookies&quot;) to ensure you get the best experience possible.</p><p data-v-733b5d30>This policy aims to provide information about how and why we use cookies. Your use of the Site is taken as acceptance of this policy.</p><p data-v-733b5d30>When accessing our Site, a window will pop up to ask you whether you agree or disagree with this policy and our use of cookies.</p><h3 data-v-733b5d30>What are cookies</h3><p data-v-733b5d30>A cookie is a piece of data that our website asks your browser to store on your device which allows us to &quot;remember&quot; your actions or preferences. They are small files of letters and numbers that may be stored on your browser or computer.</p><p data-v-733b5d30>Most browsers support cookies, but users can set their browsers to decline them and can delete them whenever they like.</p><p data-v-733b5d30>For more information on cookies visit <a href="https://www.allaboutcookies.org" data-v-733b5d30>www.allaboutcookies.org</a></p><h3 data-v-733b5d30>Why we use cookies</h3><p data-v-733b5d30>We use cookies to personalize our Site to your needs and deliver a smooth service. Cookies help us improve the performance by saving some of your requirements to:</p><ol data-v-733b5d30><li data-v-733b5d30>help you navigate between pages more efficiently</li><li data-v-733b5d30>protect your security</li><li data-v-733b5d30>remember your preferences and recognise you when you return</li><li data-v-733b5d30>allow us to customize the website to your individual needs</li><li data-v-733b5d30>measure how you are using our website to improve our services</li><li data-v-733b5d30>speed up your searches</li><li data-v-733b5d30>other reasons that improve your experience</li></ol><p data-v-733b5d30>Our cookies do not store personal information that can be used to identify you. To learn about how we use personal information you can access our Privacy Policy here.</p><h3 data-v-733b5d30>What cookies we use</h3><p data-v-733b5d30>We use:</p><ol data-v-733b5d30><li data-v-733b5d30>strictly necessary cookies</li><li data-v-733b5d30>performance cookies</li><li data-v-733b5d30>functionality cookies</li></ol><p data-v-733b5d30>Strictly necessary cookies are required for the operation of our website to help you move around the website and use features available to Free Users or Premium Users. We use strictly necessary cookies to:</p><ul data-v-733b5d30><li data-v-733b5d30>identify when you log in to the site</li><li data-v-733b5d30>provide access to protected areas of our website</li><li data-v-733b5d30>remember entered text so that it is not lost if the page refreshes</li></ul><p data-v-733b5d30>Performance cookies improve the way our Site works. We use them to analyse how visitors use our Site and monitor its performance. They tell us how people use our pages, which one is the most commonly viewed or whether any errors have occurred. They also help us identify and fix issues that arise. We use performance cookies to:</p><ul data-v-733b5d30><li data-v-733b5d30>understand the most effective linking method between pages</li><li data-v-733b5d30>enable web analytics to provide anonymous statistics about our Site</li><li data-v-733b5d30>assist with error management and help us improve the platform</li></ul><p data-v-733b5d30>Functionality cookies allow us to remember your preferences. We may store your geographic location to ensure our website is localized for your area. We also use them to provide you with enhanced services such as to allow you to access a website or comment on a blog. We use functionality cookies to:</p><ul data-v-733b5d30><li data-v-733b5d30>remember settings such as layout, colours, font and page backgrounds</li><li data-v-733b5d30>remember if we&#39;ve already asked you to fill in a survey</li><li data-v-733b5d30>detect if you have already seen our cookies pop-up</li><li data-v-733b5d30>process a request from a user to comment or blog or post on a forum</li></ul><h3 data-v-733b5d30>How long do cookies stay on your computer?</h3><p data-v-733b5d30>We use session cookies and persistent cookies.</p><p data-v-733b5d30>The session cookies are temporary and remain on your device until you leave the website. Persistent cookies are stored on your computer until you delete them or they reach their expiry date. These may be used to remember your preferences when you use our website again and recognise you upon your return.</p><h3 data-v-733b5d30>How to manage your cookies?</h3><p data-v-733b5d30>Most web browsers are set up to accept cookies. But it is your right to reject cookies. However, please be aware that restricting cookies may impact the functionality of our Site and you may be unable to access certain features of our platform.</p><p data-v-733b5d30>Unless you have adjusted your browser to refuse cookies, our system will use cookies when you direct your browser to our Site. When entering, you will be faced with a pop-up window asking you whether you would like to accept our cookies and the type of cookies we use and the information we would store while you are on the website.</p><p data-v-733b5d30>If you change your mind about our use of cookies, you can disable new cookies or delete existing ones from your browser or computer at any time.</p><h3 data-v-733b5d30>Links to other websites</h3><p data-v-733b5d30>This policy does not cover links within this website to other websites. We encourage you to read the terms of use and privacy statements on the other websites you use.</p></div></div>',1)])])}const wot={head(){return{title:"Cookie Policy | Kenmei"}}},xot=xe(wot,[["render",bot],["__scopeId","data-v-733b5d30"]]),Sot={class:"relative py-16 bg-white overflow-hidden dark_bg-slate-700"},Eot={class:"relative px-4 sm_px-6 lg_px-8"},kot={class:"mt-12 prose prose-neutral prose-lg mx-auto dark_prose-invert"},Cot={class:"align-center"};function Tot(e,t,n,r,s,i){const o=D("base-badge");return g(),R("div",Sot,[v("div",Eot,[t[13]||(t[13]=Er('<div class="text-lg max-w-prose mx-auto" data-v-05121261><h1 data-v-05121261><span class="mt-2 block text-3xl text-center leading-8 font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm_text-4xl dark_text-white" data-v-05121261>Content Guidelines</span></h1></div><div class="mt-12 prose prose-neutral prose-lg mx-auto dark_prose-invert" data-v-05121261><h2 data-v-05121261>Tutorial Video</h2><div class="aspect-w-16 aspect-h-9 bg-black rounded-lg overflow-hidden" data-v-05121261><video class="w-full h-full" controls data-v-05121261><source src="https://files.kenmei.co/assets/Data%20Moderator%20Tutorial.mp4" type="video/mp4" data-v-05121261>Your browser does not support the video tag.</video></div></div>',2)),v("div",kot,[t[12]||(t[12]=Er('<h2 data-v-05121261>Overview</h2><ul data-v-05121261><li data-v-05121261><strong data-v-05121261>No Hentai / Pornhwa:</strong> Any series with prominently visible genitals and overly explicit sex scenes are not allowed and should be rejected with <strong data-v-05121261>Pornographic</strong> reason and blacklisted. Caution should be exercised for <strong data-v-05121261>Erotica</strong> - many can be accepted. A good rule of thumb is: if a sex scene is explicit but genitals are not visible (censoring doesn&#39;t count), it&#39;s likely acceptable.</li><li data-v-05121261><strong data-v-05121261>No Self-Published Authors:</strong> Authors must have at least one previously published series, either in a magazine or on an established digital publishing platform. Carefully vet digital platforms, as some allow self-publishing (e.g., Webtoon Canvas, Pixiv).</li><li data-v-05121261><strong data-v-05121261>Short series are not allowed:</strong> A series should consist of at least 25 pages upon release, which is the average length of a one-shot. Even if an author is published, such a series should be rejected with the &#39;Series Too Short&#39; reason. The only exception is if the work itself is officially published.</li><li data-v-05121261><strong data-v-05121261>Only Manga, Manhwa and Manhua are allowed:</strong> No comics or other series (like Indonesian, etc.) are allowed. Source material must originate from Japan, Korea, or China (Hong Kong and Taiwan included).</li></ul><h2 data-v-05121261>Series</h2><h3 data-v-05121261>Title</h3><ul data-v-05121261><li data-v-05121261>Titles should not include author names or anything else except the title itself. The only exception is adding &#39;Pre-Serialization&#39; when there are serialized and non-serialized versions.</li></ul><h3 data-v-05121261>Description</h3><ul data-v-05121261><li data-v-05121261>Use official description provided when possible (use ChatGPT to translate if needed).</li><li data-v-05121261>Only include the actual description of the series. Do not add additional notes, links, or commentary. If no synopsis is available, research the story to write one yourself by reading the first chapters or consulting someone who has read the series.</li><li data-v-05121261>Avoid overly short descriptions. Aim for several lines of text (even for official descriptions). The ideal length is 500+ characters, but this is mainly a concern when rewriting existing descriptions.</li><li data-v-05121261>Long descriptions are acceptable. When possible, replace dialogue-heavy descriptions (common in shoujo) with actual plot synopsis. This typically happens when official sources are released, which avoid dialogue in descriptions.</li></ul><h3 data-v-05121261>Cover</h3><ul data-v-05121261><li data-v-05121261>When searching for a cover to upload, follow this order:<ol data-v-05121261><li data-v-05121261>Search Google for a raw, high-quality image of Volume 1</li><li data-v-05121261>If the quality is low, download <a href="https://upscayl.org/" target="_blank" data-v-05121261>Upscayl</a> and upscale using the Digital Art</li><li data-v-05121261>Otherwise, find an alternative image, such as the first page of the series</li></ol></li><li data-v-05121261>When a manga cover has excessive promotional material, prefer the light novel cover until a clean volume cover becomes available</li><li data-v-05121261>Sometimes cover cropping is necessary - prioritize showing the title while maintaining visual appeal<ul data-v-05121261><li data-v-05121261>Here is a good example of cropping out the publisher to improve how the cover looks:<table class="mt-4 mb-4 border-collapse border border-gray-300 dark_border-gray-700" data-v-05121261><thead data-v-05121261><tr data-v-05121261><th class="border border-gray-300 dark_border-gray-700 px-4 py-2 bg-gray-100 dark_bg-gray-800" data-v-05121261>Before</th><th class="border border-gray-300 dark_border-gray-700 px-4 py-2 bg-gray-100 dark_bg-gray-800" data-v-05121261>After</th></tr></thead><tbody data-v-05121261><tr data-v-05121261><td class="border border-gray-300 dark_border-gray-700 px-4 py-2 text-center" data-v-05121261><img class="max-w-full h-auto" src="https://files.kenmei.co/assets/moderation/before-image-crop.png" alt="Before cropping" data-v-05121261></td><td class="border border-gray-300 dark_border-gray-700 px-4 py